Falsifies `grant_plan::expansion::verification::a_set_never_holds_more_bytes_than_it_has`.

The defect: the room check allows one name's worth of bytes past the set's storage, so a third long name is copied past its end.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(pushed, fits)`, or the bounds check on the copy inside `insert`.

diff --git a/src/expansion.rs b/src/expansion.rs
--- a/src/expansion.rs
+++ b/src/expansion.rs
@@ -160,7 +160,7 @@
 
